[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.160]   Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for standing by, and welcome to the Aldera Therapeutic
[00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.840]   Second Quarter 2020 Financial Results Conference Call.
[00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:13.120]   At this time, all participants are in a listen only mode.
[00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:16.840]   After the speaker's remarks, there will be a question and answer session.
